<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela banks and markets closed Monday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela banks and markets closed Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan banks and financial markets are closed Monday May 12 for the Ascension of the Lord holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Tuesday May 13.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
